# Project hub

pnpm + Turborepo. Apps in `apps/`, shared code in `packages/` as `@starter/*`.

Load skills from `.agents/skills/` before large changes (`nuxt`, `nestjs-best-practices`, `turborepo`).

- `types` and `utils` stay framework-free.
- Lint with oxlint, format with oxfmt.
- Front talks to Nest only (cookie auth). Do not add a Nitro API proxy.
